<br><a href="http://www.madonnavillage.it/modules.php?name=Forums&file=viewtopic&t=25183&highlight="><img src="/images/2005/covers_competition.jpg" border="0"></a><br><br>
As we collected more than 2000 + 1000 signatures right now, we thought it would be great to give the fans a chance at <b>designing the DVD covers</b>. All the designs will be published on <a href="http://www.madonnavillage.it" targte=_blank>http://www.MadonnaVillage.it</a> - <b>Drowned Madonna's Community</b> - and you will be able to vote for your favourites. 
<br><br>
The winning entries will be sent off to all of Madonna’s people along with the petition. <br><br>

You never know what will happen if they like them. Good luck! <br><br>



Email your designs along with your name, age and address to <a href="mailto:dmcompetition@yahoo.com">dmcompetition@yahoo.com</a>.

