    <td bgcolor="#FFFFFF">
	<div align=justify><font class="storytext"><P align=left>Thrilled with the success of the <STRONG>Mylène Farmer Weekend</STRONG> that took place on April 9th and 10th, the DeeJays web radio decided to repeat the experience by dedicating <STRONG>two days of broadcast to one of the greatest singer ever: Madonna</STRONG>. It is a wonderful opportunity to pay tribute to the Queen of Pop and to (re)discover this multifaceted artist through original mixes and remixes devised by <STRONG>Paris One Deejays and remixers</STRONG>.<BR>« Since 1982, Madonna has constantly been widely talked about. She is one of the few artists, if not the only one, to have managed to keep up the pace with her times, adapting both her music and her style to the successive trends – thus evolving in synch with her audience. <STRONG>It was high time to pay tribute to this magnificent artist just days before she releases her latest album ‘Defying Gravity’. This special event will take place on July, 2nd and 3rd (Sat. &amp; Sun.) on our web radio» explains Paris One President Sébastien PETIT.<BR></STRONG>On this weekend, one-hour sets consisting of official ‘night-club’ remixes will be played by many of the radio’s resident deejays for Paris One’s audience. Yet another large part of this weekend will be dedicated to ‘non-official’ remixes and bootlegs devised by amateur remixers.<BR>« There are more and more webradios on the Internet. Some of them are nothing more than mere imitations of regular terrestrial radios, while others just mimic existing concepts. We have decided to organize more thematic weekends to differentiate ourselves and what gives an edge is our ever growing pool of deejays (23 to this date). “The more, the better for<BR>our audience!.» concludes Sébastien.<BR><BR>«<STRONG> Defying Gravity Weekend – A Tribute to Madonna », July 2nd and 3rd (Sat.&amp; Sun) on ParisOne.com<BR></STRONG>About <STRONG>Paris One</STRONG> :<BR>Paris One, a non-profit making association aiming at promoting amateur remixers and deejays through netcasts of their musical performances.Launched on February, 5th, 2005, you can listen to Paris One 24hours/day 7days/week from the following url: <A href="/cgi-bin/sqwebmail?redirect=http%3A%2F%2Fwww.paris-one.com&amp;timestamp=1119590540&amp;md5=2nlQn5Eq5swNt%2Fp3j3DXWQ%3D%3D" target=_blank><SPAN class=message-text-plain-http-link>http://www.paris-one.com</SPAN></A>. Since then, we can boast an average 40,000 visits per month.<BR><BR>Press Contact:<BR><BR>Sébastien PETIT, President<BR>presse@paris-one.com<BR><BR>Association&nbsp; PARIS ONE<BR>25, rue Thiboumery - 75015 PARIS - FRANCE<BR><BR><A href="/cgi-bin/sqwebmail?redirect=http%3A%2F%2Fwww.paris-one.com&amp;timestamp=1119590540&amp;md5=2nlQn5Eq5swNt%2Fp3j3DXWQ%3D%3D" target=_blank><SPAN class=message-text-plain-http-link>http://www.paris-one.com</SPAN></A><BR><BR>----------------------------------------------<BR>"Paris One, Listen to the next Deejayneration"<BR><A href="/cgi-bin/sqwebmail?redirect=http%3A%2F%2Fwww.paris-one.com&amp;timestamp=1119590540&amp;md5=2nlQn5Eq5swNt%2Fp3j3DXWQ%3D%3D" target=_blank><SPAN class=message-text-plain-http-link>http://www.paris-one.com</SPAN></A><BR><A href="mailto:contact@paris-one.com">contact@paris-one.com</A><BR></P>
